  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lorenzo Natali 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objective of the prize is to reward media articles and broadcasts which stand out for their focus on international cooperation and development policy and poverty eradication. The Lorenzo Natali, run by the Directorate-General for International Partnerships (DG INTPA) since 1992, has been awarded in public recognition of journalists who contribute through their work to the causes of international cooperation, development and poverty eradication.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
